    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Were gi ji pere m'oyer",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluwo gir'adieri i Kristo aka akitwodi; paro ma cunyan ridho gino gi meni pa Cuny Maleŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An gi rem kodi litho mathoth i cunyan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aparo ni di Were wokwoŋan ayin aka wopokan kodi Kristo ma bero pa ji paran, wade paran won ma del! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.4.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wok 4:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jobedo Joisiraili, ma Were oloko nyithindho pere to poko jo dwoŋ pere. Otimo cikirok pere kodi jo, to miyo jo Cik. Jonitie gi royo ma lamo Were mar'adieri. Jotieko jolo cikirok pa Were; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jowok kwoŋ kwarere wan macon, aka Kristo, paka dhano, onywole wok i dier jo. Weyi Were ma dhumo gimoro je, wopak cil gi cil. Ameno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akiwaci ni cikirok pa Were othogaya ongoye kony; rupiri k'obedo ni Joisiraili je ji pa Were; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.21.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 21:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "odoko k'obedo ni nyikway Abraham je nyithindho pa Were. Kole Were owaco ri Abraham ni, “Nyikway Isaka kende am'ibino kwano paka aperin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma nyutho ni nyithindho m'onywol i yo ma kisi ndelo manyadel jok'obedo nyithindho pa Were; kucel, nyithindho m'onywol cungo kwoŋ cikirok pa Were ama ikwano paka nyikway go mar'adieri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.18.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 18:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole cikirok pa Were otim i wac me: “I hongo marom gi ma pama yuwaŋe, abino dwoko aka Sara bino limo nyathi majayac.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka ki meno kende; nger gino bende otimere ri Rebeka munyo ogamo iye to limo nyithindho ma rut, go kodi kwari wan Isaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.25.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 25:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kada munyo fodi k'onywol jo aka onwaŋo fodi jok'otimo kiri gimoro maber kosa marac, (ma miyo yero pa Were wotimere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kareno kicungi kwoŋ tim pa nyithindho no, to kwoŋ lwoŋo pa Were), Were owaco ri Rebeka ni, “Wodin makayo bino tiyo ri mathin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAL.1.2+MAL.1.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mal 1:2-3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meno obedo paka ondiki ni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo wawaci nedi? Nike Were k'otire? K'ameno be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.33.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wok 33:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole go owaco ri Musa ni,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Keme pa Were gi wor pere",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo moro kwoŋ win bino waco ran ni. “K'inen obedo ameno, Were nyalo nedi ketho banja kwoŋ dhano? To ŋa, manyalo geŋo paro pa Were?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.29.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 29:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.45.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "45:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To jawodhan in iŋa, dhan'adhana, m'inyalo dwoko Were? Dak bende nyalo penjo ŋat'ocweyo go ni, “Raŋo m'icweyan ama?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole jacwec nigi siem ma oro lowo nyamasiga paka won oyero, gi cweyo degi ario wok i lowo acel m'odwany: Dak acel mar'aora i kabedo ma welo kodi man mar'aora i kabedo ma kisi ndelo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iŋeyo nedi, kole ka Were otimo ameno ma mito nyutho keme pere gi miyo meni pere woŋeyere! Am'omiyo go odiyo cunye swa munyo ciro joma keme pere d'otiyo kwoŋ jo, m'oyido ikidho reyo woko jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka iŋeyo nedi, kole ka Were otimo ameno ma mito nyutho dwoŋ pere m'oŋaŋ ri joma go kidho nyutho jo wor pere, ma go oyiko jolo i dwoŋ pere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole meno mako kwoŋ wan ma go olwoŋo, ki nyaka wok kwoŋ Joyuda kende, to kwoŋ Jopath bende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.2.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos 2:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.2.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 2:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole me a gima go waco i kitawo pa Hoseya:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isiraili kodi Wac Manyen Maber",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
